  STEP 1 CLASS: RELABELLING BY THE COSMIC DENSITY RATIO
  Framework's say: S1 (THEORY_CANONICAL) writes rho_DE, so the framework's own statement selects the canonical footing; it says nothing about H0, M/L or the HI flux scale. At z=0 the data measure ONE number (a0); the two footings are two hypotheses about its value: kappa_Lambda = 0.5000 and kappa_Lambda = 0.6043.

