  pin threshold: a0 precision < sigma_hat/2 = 0.0492 dex; the nearest competitor (cH_Lambda/2pi) is 0.0355 dex from canonical 1/2 (2-sigma separation needs 0.0177 dex); footings are 0.0822 dex apart (needs 0.0411)
